    "body": "Let's carefully document the cascading effects of opting out of accounts metrics.\n\nI think this should just be: opting out of FxA metrics also opts you out of all FxA RP metrics.\n\nI don't think opting out of FxA metrics should opt out of desktop/mobile client telemetry.\n\nI also don't think opting out of desktop/mobile client telemetry should opt out of FxA metrics.\n\nBut we'll need to confirm all this with legal and privacy.\n\n\n\n┆Issue is synchronized with this [Jira Task](https://jira.mozilla.com/browse/FXA-2933)\n┆Issue Number: FXA-2933\n",
